    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n112506" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φῡκίον</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φύκιον</span></b> , τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
